# CUSTOM DOMAIN PLACEHOLDER
# To use your own domain (e.g. www.dreamlandco.co.za):
#   1. Rename this file to CNAME (no extension).
#   2. Replace ALL of its contents with just your domain on one line, e.g.:
#        www.dreamlandco.co.za
#   3. Update the site address in index.html, sitemap.xml and robots.txt to match.
# (GitHub Pages reads only the first line of CNAME, so no comments in the real file.)
